		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1654EA4BC9A74F79"]
			description: [
				"The &eNASA Workbench&r is where rockets are assembled from nose cone, body, fins and engine. Every rocket in the pack is built here."
				""
				"&a&lIt is a steel recipe and nothing more.&r Steel plates, steel blocks, iron rods, a crafting table and two redstone torches. If you have been through Mekanism you can very likely build it right now."
				""
				"&7It is a multiblock-style crafting interface rather than a machine - place it, open it, and it shows you the rocket schematic slot by slot. Check JEI for the exact layout of each tier.&r"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:nasa_workbench"
			id: "51B90C3D7756A0EA"
			rewards: [{
				id: "36A0AA2157E04EA0"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Where rockets get built"
			tasks: [{
