			description: [
				"Everything is ready: steel, power, oxygen, a suit, fuel, and a workbench."
				""
				"Assemble a &eTier 1 Rocket&r, set it on a Launch Pad, fuel it, climb in, and hold SPACE. LIFTOFF."
			]
