			}]
			title: "&9The Scorched World"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A0F1081A90EE29"]
			description: [
				"&cCalorite&r is Ad Astra's top-tier metal, and the &cTier 4 Rocket&r is the only ship that leaves the solar system."
				""
				"&e&lCalorite is the endgame storage gate too.&r AE2's Spatial IO Port and every MEGA Cell are forged with it, so this trip pays for itself twice."
				""
				"&7Venus is where it comes from, and Venus is the most hostile world in the pack - acid, heat, and an atmosphere that eats standard gear.&r"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:calorite_ingot"
