		{
			dependencies: ["5954D67B54D46F03"]
			description: [
				"&9&lThe problem.&r Desh, Ostrum and Calorite only exist as ore on their own planet. Every time the pack asks for more, it is another rocket, another mining trip, another hour.&r"
				""
				"&9&lThe fix.&r Budding blocks. Same idea as an amethyst geode - a block that slowly grows crystals you can harvest forever - except these only work in orbit.&r"
				""
				"It all starts with a &eBudding Amethyst&r, and you cannot mine one: silk touch does not work on it and geodes do not generate in a void world."
				""
				"&e&lArs Nouveau makes them.&r Its budding conversion turns a plain &eAmethyst Block&r into a &eBudding Amethyst&r, which means the whole chain below is renewable from the start."
				""
				"&8Amethyst itself comes from the sieve, so you already have a supply."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:budding_amethyst"
			id: "2D5C000000000020"
			rewards: [{
					id: "2D5C000000000120"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7The seed of every farm"
			tasks: [{
					id: "2D5C000000000220"
					item: "minecraft:budding_amethyst"
					type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&9Seed Crystal"
			x: 2.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2D5C000000000020"]
			description: [
				"Ring your Budding Amethyst with &e8 Desh Blocks&r and it becomes a &eBudding Desh&r - 72 desh ingots, so this is not cheap. You have to have mined the Moon the hard way first."
				""
				"&c&lIt only grows in MOON ORBIT.&r Not on the Moon. On a &espace station&r above it. Standing on the surface does nothing at all - the block just sits there."
				""
				"&e&lHow to build the farm:&r lay a floor of Budding Desh with one empty block above each. A bud appears, then thickens into a &eDesh Cluster&r. Break the cluster for &e2 Raw Desh&r; the budding block stays and starts again."
				""
				"&6&lKeep the chunk loaded.&r Crystals grow on random ticks, and random ticks only happen in loaded, ticking chunks. &eClaim and force-load&r your station chunks with FTB Chunks (&bM&r for the map) and the farm keeps running while you are back home on the island.&r"
				""
				"&8Buds and clusters drop themselves if you break them early, so a half-grown farm can be moved."
			]
			icon: "kubejs:budding_desh"
			id: "2D5C000000000021"
			rewards: [{
					id: "2D5C000000000121"
					type: "xp_levels"
					xp_levels: 5
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Grows only above the Moon"
			tasks: [{
					id: "2D5C000000000221"
					item: "kubejs:budding_desh"
					type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&9Budding Desh"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
