			dependencies: [
				"2D5C000000000021"
				"5B3D9DD3AF77FB22"
			]
			description: [
				"The ladder continues, and it eats its own rungs: a &eBudding Desh&r ringed with &e8 Ostrum Blocks&r becomes a &eBudding Ostrum&r."
				""
				"&c&lThe Budding Desh is consumed.&r If you want to keep farming desh as well, build a second one first - another Budding Amethyst, another 8 desh blocks."
				""
				"&c&lThis one only grows in MARS ORBIT&r, so it needs its own station. Your Moon station will not do."
				""
