			description: [
				"The last rung. A &eBudding Ostrum&r ringed with &e8 Calorite Blocks&r becomes a &eBudding Calorite&r, and it grows only in &eVENUS ORBIT&r."
				""
				"Three stations, three farms, and the mining trips stop for good. Desh for tier 2 rockets and Mekanism's Elite circuits, ostrum for tier 3 and Ultimate circuits, calorite for tier 4 - all of it renewable from here."
				""
				"&6&lThis is what space stations are for.&r Everything else in orbit is a view. This is a factory floor.&r"
